#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/common/polar.py:158
msgid "使用预分配的二维数组存储中间 LLR 和 partial sums, 避免递归中频繁分配内存。"
msgstr ""
"Uses pre-allocated 2D arrays to store intermediate LLRs and partial sums,"
" avoiding frequent memory allocation in recursion."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/common/polar.py:169
msgid "预计算所有子树的类型: 0=rate-0, 1=rate-1, 2=partial。"
msgstr "Pre-computes the type of all subtrees: 0=rate-0, 1=rate-1, 2=partial."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/common/polar.py:171
msgid "使用前缀和做 O(1) 范围查询, 迭代遍历避免递归开销。 rate-0/rate-1 子树不再向下遍历, 与 SSC 剪枝对齐。"
msgstr ""
"Uses prefix sums for O(1) range queries; iterative traversal avoids "
"recursion overhead. rate-0/rate-1 subtrees are not traversed further, "
"aligned with SSC pruning."

#: ../../../src/nearlink_sdr/common/polar.py:177
